au:doc-plea-akhimie a uco-core:UcoObject ;
	uco-core:name "Plea agreement, Ehis Lawrence Akhimie" ;
	uco-core:description "CourtListener document 443127169, entered on the docket 2025-06-17. He agrees to plead guilty to Count 1, conspiracy to commit mail and wire fraud, 18 U.S.C. § 1349. The government agrees to seek dismissal of the remaining counts as to him after sentencing. The attached factual proffer was not readable in the local text extract. No proffer fact is added. This is not a judgment, and it is not a plea by Kelly Augustine Jr." .
au:doc-sentence-akhimie a uco-core:UcoObject ;
	uco-core:name "Government sentencing memorandum, Ehis Lawrence Akhimie" ;
	uco-core:description "CourtListener document 451481738, entered 2025-09-04. The memorandum states that he pleaded guilty to the conspiracy and was scheduled to be sentenced on 2025-09-11. It describes a multi-year inheritance scheme and recommends 97 months. That recommendation is not a sentence imposed." .
